From 74d74d7df7fc94463b3efe8859d230d471c9a1f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:52:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/33] feat(gui): paper key, key QR code and key import from
 text

Next to the encryption key field:
- Print (paper key): saves the key file as a printable HTML page with its
  QR code, optionally re-wrapped with a passphrase first.
- Show the key and its QR code, from the same export.
- Import a key from text or a QR code: rebuilds a key file from a pasted
  key file, a scanned QR code or a paper key (passphrase-protected keys
  are unlocked, since the GUI only uses unprotected key files), written
  where the user chooses and never over an existing file.
Strings in fr/en/it/de/pl.
